wants to serve to the extent that he believes

00:01:56.900 --> 00:01:58.260
that that's what he's doing.

00:01:58.260 --> 00:02:00.170
But this is just not who we need in the race
right now.

00:02:00.170 --> 00:02:04.120
And I would actually make the case that if
Michael Bloomberg wants to help remove Trump,

00:02:04.120 --> 00:02:07.660
there are other way more effective ways he
can do it than simply running for president.

00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:13.540
There's a report that Amazon founder, Jeff
Bezos reportedly asked Michael Bloomberg to

00:02:13.540 --> 00:02:18.610
run, which really shows us the class based
realities of our society.

00:02:18.610 --> 00:02:21.200
You are turbo billionaire Jeff Bezos.

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:25.210
You don't like the way that billionaire president
Donald Trump is running the country.

00:02:25.210 --> 00:02:28.780
So your idea is what's replaced them with
a different billionaire.

00:02:28.780 --> 00:02:33.340
Michael Bloomberg, one with a different, certainly
level of intelligence and sophistication and

00:02:33.340 --> 00:02:34.340
different politics.

00:02:34.340 --> 00:02:37.170
It's the epitome actually of the American
class hierarchy.

00:02:37.170 --> 00:02:43.640
Now, let's assume for a second that Michael
Bloomberg genuinely just wants to remove Donald

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:44.640
Trump.

00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:49.670
