rather than running for president, which risks

00:02:55.030 --> 00:02:58.800
helping Trump actually by pulling some democratic
support.

00:02:58.800 --> 00:03:02.350
Who knows if maybe he'll end up running an
independent campaign or write in or something

00:03:02.350 --> 00:03:05.850
