I saw Jennifer Ruben write an article about
it.

00:03:29.240 --> 00:03:32.780
I believe Kellyanne Conway's husband might've
tweeted about this.

00:03:32.780 --> 00:03:38.180
If Bloomberg buys Fox news and just shuts
